# CCIP Cross-Chain Transfer Configuration
# To enable real CCIP transfers on approve:
# 1. Get testnet ETH for gas: https://sepoliafaucet.com
# 2. Get testnet LINK for CCIP fees: https://faucets.chain.link/sepolia
# 3. Add your funded Sepolia private key below:
CCIP_PRIVATE_KEY=

# Optional: Custom RPC endpoints (defaults to public nodes)
SEPOLIA_RPC_URL=https://ethereum-sepolia-rpc.publicnode.com
ARBITRUM_SEPOLIA_RPC_URL=https://arbitrum-sepolia-rpc.publicnode.com
